    bbox_width: 5-7 [observed]
    structure: |
      UD-symmetric: upper half == vertically-flipped lower half.
      Each row has a contiguous run of fg pixels with odd width [observed].
      Row widths increase by 0 or 2 per step within each half [observed].
      Concentric two-layer coloring: border_color = all fg pixels 4-adjacent
      to bg; fill_color = all interior fg pixels. Strict separation [observed].
    upper_half_widths: non-decreasing or non-monotone (e.g. 1,3,5,3 or 1,3,3,5 or 3,5,7) [observed]
